    <string name="music_import_explain">ARVIO can rebuild your Spotify playlists and liked songs from your own music sources. Spotify itself is not played.\n\n1. Export your library: at exportify.app (CSV per playlist, including Liked Songs), or with Spotify\'s own \"Download your data\" (the zip, or YourLibrary.json and Playlist files).\n2. Choose those files here.\n\nSongs your sources don\'t have are left out.</string>
